msgid "You have configured at least one paid product but have not enabled any payment methods."
msgstr "Has configurado al menos un servicio de pago pero no has activado ningún método de pago."

msgid "You have configured at least one paid product but have not configured a currency."
msgstr "Has configurado al menos un servicio de pago pero no has configurado una divisa."

