msgstr "Descripción del proceso de pago en los correos de confirmación de reserva"

msgid "This text will be included for the {payment_info} placeholder in order confirmation mails. It should instruct the user on how to proceed with the payment. You can use the placeholders {order}, {amount}, {currency} and {amount_with_currency}."
