msgid "This product is currently not being sold since you configured below that it should only be available in a certain timeframe."
msgstr "Este servicio no está abierto a reservas actualmente porque se configuró para que solo esté disponible en un periodo de tiempo determinado."

msgid "This product is currently not being shown since you configured below that it should only be visible if a certain other quota is already sold out."
msgstr "Este servicio no se muestra actualmente porque se configuró para que solo sea visible si otro cupo determinado ya está completo."

