msgid "You can use placeholders in custom texts on tickets to enrich your text with individual data. Which placeholders are available depends on your event settings, activated plugins, the selected product, as well as user input. This page lists all placeholders technically available for your event, however most of them can also be empty in some cases depending on configuration."
